{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01284","headline":"相和歌辞 怨诗 · 刘元济","name":"相和歌辞 怨诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉关芳信断，兰闺锦字新。\n愁来好自抑，念切已含嚬。\n虚牖风惊梦，空牀月厌人。\n归期傥可促，勿度柳园春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘元济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}